    <h2 id="managed-heading">Managed hosting via Sledgehammer</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Rather not run servers? <a href="https://sledgehammerinfosystems.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sledgehammer Infosystems</a> hosts, updates, and supports GatherPack for you.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard $50/mo</strong> — hosting, updates, and support included.</li>
      <li><strong>Custom $100/mo + plugin development</strong> — when you need workflow-specific plugins or deeper help.</li>
      <li><strong>FIRST teams discounted significantly</strong> — at cost, more or less — <a href="/hosting/">see hosting details</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> for current numbers.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mb-0">Both paths are the same GatherPack. See the side-by-side below and the dedicated <a href="/hosting/">hosting &amp; pricing page</a> (also at alias <code>/pricing</code>).</p>
  </div>
</section>

