  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can I really self-host for free?</h3>
    <p>Yes. The MIT license means $0 for the software — you just bring the server. Docs are in the <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repo</a>.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">What’s the catch with managed hosting?</h3>
    <p>No catch — same GatherPack, we just handle servers, updates, backups, and Stripe integration. Standard $50/mo, Custom $100/mo + plugin work. <a href="/hosting/">Hosting details</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">Is the source actually open?</h3>
    <p>Yes — <code>https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack</code> (canonical casing <code>GatherPack/gatherpack</code>). Issues and contributions are welcome via GitHub and <a href="https://discord.gg/r3fmNDVn3N" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a>.</p>
